  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GMY40Rj.png\" width=\"420\" height=\"124\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-專用-d9aa6b?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=condaforge&amp;logoColor=d9aa6b&amp;labelColor=26303d\" alt=\"\" width=\"140\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-core\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/需要-Upgraded Core-F16436?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;labelColor=1C1C1C\" alt=\"\" width=\"239\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgradedtools/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:73250\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.18.x-開發中-green?style=plastic\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-tools/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:73407\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.19.x-開發中-green?style=plastic\" width=\"166\" height=\"18\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">請使用CurseForge下載，請勿重新托管檔案。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">此模組可用於任何整合包（在CurseForge上）。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">目前暫無開發Fabric版本的計劃。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">已支援更多模組材料，未來將持續新增：<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-upgraded-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">更多升級工具</span></a>。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>模組介紹</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">添加可同時作為劍、斧、鎬、鏟和鋤使用的多功能戰鎚。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">兼容升級版地獄合金/終極合金/創造合金</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>附魔效果</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>戰鎚時間（僅限戰鎚）（1.19.2-2.1.0.2+）</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">戰鎚時間 I：3x3x1範圍採集 & 採集速度提升20%</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">戰鎚時間 II：3x3x2範圍採集 & 採集速度提升30%</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">戰鎚時間 III：3x3x3範圍採集 & 採集速度提升40%</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">僅當採集2個以上方塊時才會提升採集速度。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>其他模組作品</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.20+版本</span></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/DDjo2cf.png\" width=\"262\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/jTc5hni.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/oC1EQZw.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"78\"></a></p>